{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1794499506,"nonce":"Y8g68zgOlmOUmIDWhjWymGOF/TE=","message":"Landed on `roadmap-190c308-integration` (f6d9b58..05d6065).\n\n**Changes**\n- src/ui/history.rs: new. History list (date, titles, winner, preset), OpenHistory/HistoryOpened restore input+result with no pipeline task, delete with confirm, plus tests\n- src/ui/settings.rs: new. Settings screen with masked key field (goes only to save_api_key, used in-app only after the Keychain accepts it), models, rpm, IVA/Régimen %, ML threshold, FX override, language, theme. Save on change, \"22,5\" parses to 2250 bp, rpm change rebuilds the client, plus tests\n- src/ui/mod.rs: Messages OpenHistory, HistoryLoaded, HistoryOpened, DeleteHistory (with AskDeleteHistory/CancelDeleteHistory/HistoryDeleted), SettingsChanged, SettingsInput, SaveApiKey/ApiKeySaved, SavePreset/PresetSaved/PresetNameChanged; new App state; screens wired\n- src/ui/input.rs: preset name field and Save preset button for the free-text preset, persisted via Store::save_preset; several helpers made pub(super)\n- src/ui/results.rs: finish_run sets stale from a cost-settings mismatch; helpers made pub(super)\n- src/ui/header.rs: segment/segmented made pub(super) and reused in Settings\n- src/i18n.rs: 31 new Keys (ES/EN)\n- src/theme/styles.rs, src/theme/mod.rs: button_destructive for delete confirm\n- src/demo.rs: demo_history() fixture so history snaps are populated\n\n**Gates:** fmt ok · clippy ok · tests ok (227 passed, 1 ignored) · scraper-tests n/a\n**Review:** 3 findings — 3 auto, 0 by hand, 0 deferred\n- Manual acceptance not performed (needs a real Keychain and an interactive session): save key, restart, key still loaded. The Keychain code path is the existing, unchanged load_api_key/save_api_key.\n- Snaps for history and settings were generated in all 4 combos (scripts/snap.sh history|settings) and I viewed 3 of the 4 settings combos and